glance — THIRD-PARTY / VENDORED CODE NOTICE
===========================================

glance vendors and adapts portions of source code from the project:

    mdterm
    https://github.com/bahdotsh/mdterm
    License: MIT

The vendored code has been lifted and modified ("lift + adapt") to fit glance's
own type model (its Line / Span / Style / cell abstractions and theme). It is not
a verbatim copy. The original work is licensed under the MIT License, reproduced
in full below, and its copyright notice is retained as required by that license.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Vendored modules / files
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following glance sources are derived from mdterm. Each maps to its origin in
the mdterm source tree:

  glance image rendering
      derived from  mdterm  src/image.rs
      (terminal image ladder: Kitty / Kitty-Unicode / iTerm2 / Sixel /
       Terminology / Unicode half-block fallback; cell-metric detection;
       background fetch + cache)

  glance mermaid / diagram rendering
      derived from  mdterm  src/diagram.rs
      (Mermaid flowchart parser, topological layering, barycenter ordering,
       box-art Canvas renderer)

  glance JSON viewer
      derived from  mdterm  src/json.rs
      (semantic JSON pretty-printer, collapsible card view, and JSON graph view)

  glance LaTeX-to-Unicode math conversion
      derived from  mdterm  src/markdown.rs  (the `render_math` function and its
      LaTeX-to-Unicode symbol tables)

